<title>UK: Hyder water div sees management shuffle.</title>
<headline>Hyder water div sees management shuffle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Welsh multi-utility Hyder Plc Plc said chief executive of Graham Hawker would also take on the post of chairman of its water and sewerage business, Dwr Cymru Welsh Water.</p>
<p>This follows the retirement on July 25 of Brian Charles, who had been chairman of this unit.</p>
<p>Charles' retirement was announced on April 2.</p>
<p>Dr. Michael Brooker was appointed an executive director of Hyder on April 2 and holds the post of managing director of Dwr Cymru Welsh Water.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
